<title>USA: Omnipoint in deal with Australian operator.</title>
<headline>Omnipoint in deal with Australian operator.</headline>
<dateline>CEDAR KNOLLS, N.J. 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Omnipoint Corp's Omnipoint Communications Services Inc said Tuesday the Australian wireless operator Optus Communications Pty Ltd launched operational international roaming with the company.</p>
<p>Omnipoint said Australia is the seventeenth country to open for roaming with the company.</p>
<p>Omnipoint said its global system for mobile communications technology allows customers to take all their features and services with them when they travel.</p>
</text>
